>
  <p>
    Property managers, real estate agents, and other businesses that regularly need plumbing, heating, cooling, or electrical work can join our Customer Service Partner Program for priority scheduling and consolidated billing.
  </p>

  <h2>Program benefits</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Priority scheduling across multiple properties</li>
    <li>A dedicated point of contact for recurring needs</li>
    <li>Consolidated monthly invoicing options</li>
    <li>Preferred partner pricing on qualifying volume</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Who it's for</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Property management companies</li>
    <li>Real estate agents managing pre-sale repairs or inspections</li>
    <li>Contractors needing licensed trade subcontracting</li>
  </ul>

  <p>
    To join, reach out through our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a> with a bit about your portfolio or business, and our partnerships team will follow up.
  </p>
